      "date": "2026-05-16T19:41:43.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: Revenues exceed analysts expectations while EPS lags behind",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.41 (down from ₹3.52 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹4.57b (up 28% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹54.9m (down 89% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.2% (down from 13% in FY 2025). Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 1.3%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 146%. Revenue is forecast to grow 2.8% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 21% growth forecast for the Consumer Services industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 14% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 45% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
